    "body": "claimed: bherbruck (Claude Code session) · 2026-11-07T23:45:09Z · branch issue/207-section-door-icons (fork bherbruck/Camcraft) · cause: the ribbon's operation-section dropdown doors (Milling…, Milling 2D…, Milling 3D…, Drilling…, Multi-axis…) are drawn with no glyph by design (`icon_of` returns None for `Cmd::More`), so on a stock install with no pins every Create cell is text-only. Plan: each section door wears the glyph of its section's first operation kind (existing op icons, no new art), with a UI test that every ribbon cell but the Machine/View doors carries an icon. Outside contributor without label rights - please add `claimed`.",
